			<item>
				<title>Black Out Your Screen for the Seat Next to You</title>
				<link>http://localhost:3001/reviews/3m-gold-privacy-filter/</link>
				<pubDate>Sun, 03 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:3001/reviews/3m-gold-privacy-filter/</guid>
				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Gold micro-louvers cut off the view sharply beyond ~30 degrees.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Head-on, the screen stays bright — less dimming than cheaper films.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Reversible: gold side for a brighter look, matte side to also kill glare.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Slide-mount tabs or adhesive; comes off for screen-sharing.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=3M&amp;#43;Gold&amp;#43;Privacy&amp;#43;Filter&amp;#43;laptop&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;3M Gold Privacy Filter&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;where-youre-actually-exposed&#34;&gt;Where you&amp;rsquo;re actually exposed&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Airport lounges, the middle seat, open conference rooms, a coffee shop with your back to the room — anyone beside or behind you can read a financial model or an email thread. A privacy filter makes your screen look black to them. If you work in public, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=3M&amp;#43;Gold&amp;#43;Privacy&amp;#43;Filter&amp;#43;laptop&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; class=&#34;out aff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;3M Gold Privacy Filter&#34; data-cta=&#34;in-content&#34;&gt;check the Amazon price for your screen size&lt;svg class=&#34;out-ico&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;12&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2.5&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
